; A generated posting to a bracket-virtual account still must balance, so
; the unbalanced transaction is rejected after the automated transaction
; extends it (src/xact.cc:1677-1684, xact_base_t::verify at
; src/xact.cc:1040-1110).

= /Food/
    [Budget:Food]    -1

2026/01/01 lunch
    Expenses:Food    10.00 USD
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 11:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 9-11:
> 2026/01/01 lunch
>     Expenses:Food    10.00 USD
>     Assets:Cash
Unbalanced remainder is:
          -10.00 USD
Amount to balance against:
           10.00 USD
While applying automated transaction from "$FILE", lines 6-7:
> = /Food/
>     [Budget:Food]    -1
While extending transaction from "$FILE", lines 9-11:
> 2026/01/01 lunch
>     Expenses:Food    10.00 USD
>     Assets:Cash
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
